# Performance

- Keep state near consumers and effects correct with complete cleanup.
- Keep render functions pure and constants outside components.
- Use memoization only when computation or stable identity matters.
- Use virtualized lists with stable keys for unbounded data (transactions, SMS inbox).
- Prefer repository queries with limits over loading entire tables into memory.
- Measure before trading clarity for optimization.
